{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/280403/", "pk": 280403, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/", "pk": 4476, "shortname": "baycitybike", "name": "Bay City Bike", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Alcatraz & Full Day Electric Bike Rental", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 2, "unicode": "Alcatraz & Full Day Electric Bike Rental", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 96.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 96.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": true, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 38675, "description": "***The day you book is the Alcatraz Tour; You can pick up your bike on same or next day.***\n\nCombine a visit to Alcatraz Island with a self-guided electric bike ride along San Francisco’s waterfront. Explore the legendary prison, then cruise iconic sights and enjoy stunning views at your own pace.\n\n\n\n***This tour is for age 13 & up***\nBeginner to Novice\n_______________________\n\n##Activity details\n\nStart the day with an official Alcatraz visit, including round-trip ferry and the multilingual cell house audio tour. After returning to Pier 33, walk to the nearby bike shop for your full-day e-bike rental. Ride along the waterfront to the Golden Gate Bridge, Presidio, Marina, Crissy Field, Fort Point, and Sausalito. Explore at your own pace with an included map and route guidance.\n\n***Alcatraz Info***\nAlcatraz departure time will be sent approximately 3 days before your tour. \n\nBoats depart from Pier 33. Arrive a minimum of 30 minutes before your departure. All riders’ names must have been submitted with booking. Riders MUST present ID at tour time.\n\n***Bike Info***\nE-bikes for ages 13+ (under 18 with adult); pick up at ***2661 Taylor Street TOUR CENTER*** in Fisherman’s Wharf, same or next day.\n\n###What's included\n\n* Official Alcatraz Island visit with award-winning audio tour\n* Round-trip ferry from Pier 33 included\n* Self-guided e-bike rental for full-day waterfront exploration\n* Helmet, lock, and map", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "#Bring a copy of this voucher to redeem your tours!\n\n**Note, The day you book is the Alcatraz Tour**\n\n•  Alcatraz Tour starting time:  This will be sent to you 4 days prior to the reservation date; Typically it is a morning departure time.\n\n•  Bike rental will be booked for the same day of the Alcatraz tour. Call us if you want to do it on a different day.\n\n•  We take a monetary authorization on all rentals, starting at $500 per Ebike. The authorized amount is held until we have the safe return of all rental equipment.", "cancellation_notes": "#All Alcatraz packages are non-refundable once booked. \n**Cancellation and No-Show Policy:** \n\n• Cancellations and no-shows for Alcatraz Packages are non-refundable. Reservation no shows are charged in full.\n\n**Changed Reservation Dates Policy:** \n\n• Alcatraz trips cannot be modified in anyway. Bike Tour date and times may be re-scheduled as desired by contacting the Reservation desk but are non-refundable.\n\n**Reservation Terms & Conditions**\n\n• FOR ALCATRAZ: Please arrive at Pier 33, Alcatraz Landing, at least 30 minutes prior to your scheduled departure date and time. Failure to do so may result in the cancellation of your trip. Bring ID\n• FOR BIKE TOUR: Please arrive at 2661 Taylor St, at least 30 minutes prior to your scheduled departure date and time. Bring Credit Card and ID.\n• It is not transferable, has no cash value, and may be redeemed only once.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Visit Alcatraz & ride an e-bike along San Francisco’s waterfront", "short_description": "Combine an official Alcatraz Island visit with a full-day self-guided electric bike rental to explore San Francisco’s waterfront and iconic sights.", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/280403/images/544441/", "pk": 544441, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/5KlLVEpKQFCR2lAnnUNA", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/5KlLVEpKQFCR2lAnnUNA", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/280403/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/5KlLVEpKQFCR2lAnnUNA", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/5KlLVEpKQFCR2lAnnUNA", "is_low_resolution": true, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/280403/images/525580/", "pk": 525580, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/YaeKVk5sRvSZb9uj9Zr6", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/YaeKVk5sRvSZb9uj9Zr6", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/280403/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/YaeKVk5sRvSZb9uj9Zr6", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/YaeKVk5sRvSZb9uj9Zr6", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false},